WEBVTT

00:06:00.016 --> 00:06:05.901
which has one of the lowest
public green space per capita

00:06:05.925 --> 00:06:08.129
among megacities in Asia.

00:06:09.833 --> 00:06:14.664
Our project's become
the first new public park

00:06:14.688 --> 00:06:17.238
in almost 30 years.

00:06:17.712 --> 00:06:20.149
The 11-acre park --

00:06:20.173 --> 00:06:24.258
a big green crack
at the heart of Bangkok --

00:06:24.282 --> 00:06:26.032
opened just last year.

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:28.215
(Applause and cheers)

00:06:28.239 --> 00:06:29.434
Thank you.

00:06:29.458 --> 00:06:33.546
(Applause)